                "\"Insert\"", FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro", FontWeight -> 
                 "SemiBold", FontColor -> GrayLevel[0.28627], FontSize -> 14, 
                 StripOnInput -> False], 
                StyleBox[
                "\" \[FilledRightTriangle] \"", FontFamily -> 
